      "side": 1,
      "message": "The design here is that there\u0027s now two queues between the ap and usb. ap-\u003esigner, then signer-\u003eusb. So data is enqueued from the ap, goes to the signer, gets hashed, enqueues to usb, then is sent over usb. So there are actually more queues.\n\nOnce could be named \"ap_to_usb\" and not actually go to usb, but that would be confusing.\n\nYour earlier feedback asking for comments/docs makes sense, I\u0027ll add a description of what\u0027s happening so it\u0027s more clear to someone just looking at the code.",
